# Environment — Money Autopilot / Hermes

Copy to `.env` in project root (or set in Hostinger / n8n).

```bash
# Public URL of Money Autopilot server (required for calendar links + n8n)
APP_BASE_URL=https://autopilot.moneymagnettools.com

# Optional: require n8n / external webhooks to send this header
HERMES_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-long-random-secret

# 33333 Autopilot Revenue (consumer lane)
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_SHEET_ID=
GOOGLE_DRIVE_VAULT_FOLDER=
LEAD_MAGNET_BASE_URL=https://autopilot.moneymagnettools.com/33333
FOUNDER_EMAIL=you@example.com
EMAIL_API_URL=
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
N33333_WEBHOOK_SECRET=your-33333-n8n-secret

# Calendar timezone — match primary Google Calendar
APPROVAL_REMINDER_TZ=America/New_York

# Notion (existing SGOS)
NOTION_APPROVAL_QUEUE_URL=https://notion.so/...
NOTION_MASTER_MAP_URL=https://notion.so/...
NOTION_HERMES_STATUS_URL=https://notion.so/...
```

## n8n environment

In n8n → Settings → Variables (or workflow env):

| Variable | Value |
|----------|--------|
| `APP_BASE_URL` | Same as above |
| `HERMES_WEBHOOK_SECRET` | Same as server (if set) |

Import workflows:
- **`docs/n8n/sgos-hermes-calendar.workflow.json`** — SGOS/Hermes calendar (governance lane)
- **`docs/n8n/33333-autopilot-revenue-engine.workflow.json`** — 33333 revenue autopilot (consumer lane)

## 33333 Autopilot Revenue (consumer lane — separate from SGOS)

| Variable | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `GEMINI_API_KEY` | Google Gemini content generation |
| `GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` | Analytics dashboard sheet |
| `GOOGLE_DRIVE_VAULT_FOLDER` | Asset backup folder ID |
| `LEAD_MAGNET_BASE_URL` | Base URL for free download pages |
| `FOUNDER_EMAIL` | Daily Lockdown summary recipient |
| `EMAIL_API_URL` | ConvertKit/MailerLite API endpoint |
| `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` | Revenue tracking (Lockdown 9PM) |

See **`docs/33333/33333_QUICK_START_GUIDE.md`** for 7-day launch plan.
